    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TCG Master Trader</strong> is a <strong>free to play</strong> card-collecting experience where every few hours brings new surprises and new cards to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real Time Based Drops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 4 hours, players can claim a fresh pack of 5 random cards, added straight to their personal collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301740/extras/a033791eef4cb32d12bfee529fea0d6d.poster.avif?t=1746870875\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301740/extras/a033791eef4cb32d12bfee529fea0d6d.webm?t=1746870875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301740/extras/a033791eef4cb32d12bfee529fea0d6d.mp4?t=1746870875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card drops are <strong>real time-based</strong>, meaning the timer counts down even while the game is closed \u2014 you don\u2019t need to be online or actively playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just come back to claim your rewards\u2026 or <strong>enable Auto-Claim</strong> to receive your packs automatically!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During special events or promotions, drop intervals may change or include bonus packs. To be the first to know when that happens, <strong>join our official Discord community</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card Collection &amp; Binder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Binder:</strong> Dive into your binder to browse your collection, examine your cards, and enjoy the unique designs and visual styles of each pull.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>144 unique base cards</strong>, but with multiple styles, borders, and foils, there\u2019s a total of <strong>1,728 cards to collect, and more to come</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drop Rates &amp; Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each pack contains 5 randomly generated cards with a random rarity, border, foil and art type. Here\u2019s what you can expect:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Rarities:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Common \u2013 70%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Uncommon \u2013 20.71%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rare \u2013 8.28%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Epic \u2013 1%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Legendary \u2013 0.01%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Border Styles:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Basic \u2013 80%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gold \u2013 17%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Radiant \u2013 3%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art Versions:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Standard \u2013 90%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Full Art \u2013 10%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foil Variants:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Non-Foiled \u2013 95%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Foiled \u2013 5%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Marketplace Freedom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All cards in your collection can be listed on the Steam Community Market! You can freely <strong>buy and sell cards</strong> with other players to build your binder, hunt for rare variants, or simply manage your growing collection however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Highlights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Free card packs every 4 hours</strong> \u2013 Always something new to look forward to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Fully interactive card binder</strong> \u2013 Organize, admire, and display your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Deep customization possibilities</strong> \u2013 Rarities, borders, art styles, and foils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Steam Market integration</strong> \u2013 Buy and sell with players worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 1,728 collectible card variations</strong> \u2013 Will you collect them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the Collection Craze</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual collector, a hardcore completionist, or just love the thrill of opening card packs, <strong>TCG Master Trader</strong> is the perfect place to build your ultimate card collection.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TCG Master Trader</strong> is a <strong>free to play</strong> card-collecting experience where every few hours brings new surprises and new cards to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real Time Based Drops</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 4 hours, players can claim a fresh pack of 5 random cards, added straight to their personal collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301740/extras/a033791eef4cb32d12bfee529fea0d6d.poster.avif?t=1746870875\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301740/extras/a033791eef4cb32d12bfee529fea0d6d.webm?t=1746870875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301740/extras/a033791eef4cb32d12bfee529fea0d6d.mp4?t=1746870875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card drops are <strong>real time-based</strong>, meaning the timer counts down even while the game is closed \u2014 you don\u2019t need to be online or actively playing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just come back to claim your rewards\u2026 or <strong>enable Auto-Claim</strong> to receive your packs automatically!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During special events or promotions, drop intervals may change or include bonus packs. To be the first to know when that happens, <strong>join our official Discord community</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Card Collection &amp; Binder</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Binder:</strong> Dive into your binder to browse your collection, examine your cards, and enjoy the unique designs and visual styles of each pull.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>144 unique base cards</strong>, but with multiple styles, borders, and foils, there\u2019s a total of <strong>1,728 cards to collect, and more to come</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Drop Rates &amp; Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each pack contains 5 randomly generated cards with a random rarity, border, foil and art type. Here\u2019s what you can expect:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Rarities:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Common \u2013 70%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Uncommon \u2013 20.71%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rare \u2013 8.28%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Epic \u2013 1%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Legendary \u2013 0.01%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Border Styles:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Basic \u2013 80%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gold \u2013 17%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Radiant \u2013 3%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art Versions:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Standard \u2013 90%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Full Art \u2013 10%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foil Variants:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Non-Foiled \u2013 95%</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Foiled \u2013 5%</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Marketplace Freedom</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All cards in your collection can be listed on the Steam Community Market! You can freely <strong>buy and sell cards</strong> with other players to build your binder, hunt for rare variants, or simply manage your growing collection however you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Highlights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Free card packs every 4 hours</strong> \u2013 Always something new to look forward to.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Fully interactive card binder</strong> \u2013 Organize, admire, and display your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Deep customization possibilities</strong> \u2013 Rarities, borders, art styles, and foils.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Steam Market integration</strong> \u2013 Buy and sell with players worldwide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 1,728 collectible card variations</strong> \u2013 Will you collect them all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the Collection Craze</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual collector, a hardcore completionist, or just love the thrill of opening card packs, <strong>TCG Master Trader</strong> is the perfect place to build your ultimate card collection.</p>",
